Section: Tweaks
Homepage: https://github.com/ibrahim2100/albrhi-repo
Description: One tweak for Instagram, YouTube, X and TikTok, switched per app from Settings.
 .
 Everything Albrhi makes for social apps, in a single package. Install this and you have
 the Instagram tweak, the YouTube tweak, the X tweak and the TikTok tweak; there is
 nothing else to download and one thing to update.
 .
 ▍CHOOSE FROM SETTINGS
 Settings › Albrhi lists every app Albrhi patches, with a switch each. Turn one off and
 Albrhi does nothing inside that app — no uninstalling, and your settings are kept for
 when you turn it back on. Close and reopen the app for a change to take effect.
 .
 ▍INSTAGRAM
 A download button in every post and reel, a Download Center with a real queue, a feed
 without ads or suggestions, watching stories without telling anyone, and confirmations
 before a mis-tap becomes a notification.
 .
 ▍YOUTUBE
 Downloads with their own player and Download Centre tab, no ads, SponsorBlock, playback
 that keeps going in the background, and a quality ceiling per connection.
 .
 ▍X
 Save any video, photo or GIF to Photos — a download button on the video itself, at the
 best quality X offers, plus a list of everything it has shown you. Plus no ads, no Promote button, no Grok, no Premium nags,
 less tracking, no view counts and a faster launch. Hold two fingers anywhere in X.
 .
 ▍TIKTOK
 No ads — including the launch splash ad — and a download button right in the feed,
 beside like, comment and share, for the video actually on screen, at the best quality
 TikTok offers — and photo posts save as photos, every image in the post. A seek bar
 that stays under the video instead of appearing only while you drag. Three separate
 privacy switches: no story-seen mark, no read receipt sent for a message, no
 profile-view report — turn off just the one you want. Plus the jailbreak hidden from
 every check TikTok asks. Hold two fingers anywhere in TikTok for a real settings
 screen — a switch and an explanation for each feature, what has been resolved for
 download, and live numbers behind every hook.
 .
 ▍GROWING
 New Albrhi tweaks arrive in this same package and appear in the same list, so there is
 never a second thing to install.
 .
 Arabic and English throughout.
 .
 Developed by Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn. The Instagram tweak is an educational and corrective
 derivative of SCInsta by SoCuul, rebuilt with AI assistance to improve code quality,
 design, performance and user experience. Open source under the GNU GPL v3, with
 original authorship credited and preserved.
Tag: role::enduser
